OL,6,FThousands of people are expected to
OL,7,Ftake part in the Great South Run 2026
OL,9,FThe race across the Portsmouth area is
OL,10,F10 miles long
OL,12,FIt starts on Southsea Common and the
OL,13,Ffinish line is near Southsea Castle
OL,15,FThere have been 36 races since the
OL,16,Fevent launched in 1990
